Title: laundromat

[[rdg
Tone: Sitcom
Start: Two strangers discover that each has one half of a torn winning lottery ticket.
End: They agree to split the prize, then notice the draw date is tomorrow.
]]

[[character: Nora
Voice: Dry, practical, suspicious of good luck.
Want: Finish the laundry and avoid getting involved.
Obstacle: The stranger will not give back her half of the ticket.
]]

[[character: Eli
Voice: Overconfident, chatty; bargains when nervous.
Want: Convince Nora they are destined to win.
Obstacle: He has been wrong about every prediction tonight.
]]

INT. ALL-NIGHT LAUNDROMAT — 3 A.M.
